<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>市政府道路巡檢系統｜靜態斑馬線硬體危險度評估平台</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/onnxruntime-web/dist/ort.min.js"></script>
  <style>
    :root {
      /* 日系文具簡約：森林綠 + 米白紙張 + 印章紅點綴 */
      --bg-paper: #F7F5EE;
      --bg-card: #FCFBF7;
      --bg-sub: #EFECE2;
      --ink-primary: #1B241E;
      --ink-secondary: #4D5951;
      --ink-muted: #76827A;
      --forest-green: #1E4D36;
      --forest-light: #2D6A4F;
      --forest-tint: #E4EDE8;
      --stamp-red: #B8332A;
      --stamp-tint: #F9E8E6;
      --border-line: #CFCBC0;
      --border-strong: #1B241E;
      --grid-dot: rgba(27, 36, 30, 0.08);
      --font-mono: 'IBM Plex Mono', 'Noto Sans TC', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
      --font-sans: 'Noto Sans TC', 'IBM Plex Mono', sans-serif;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      background-color: var(--bg-paper);
      background-image: radial-gradient(var(--grid-dot) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 16px 16px;
      color: var(--ink-primary);
      line-height: 1.65;
      font-size: 14px;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    /* 導覽列 */
    header.topbar {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .topbar-inner {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand-stamp {
      border: 2px solid var(--stamp-red);
      color: var(--stamp-red);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
      background: var(--stamp-tint);
      user-select: none;
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--forest-green);
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .brand-code {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background-color: var(--forest-green);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.18s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background-color: var(--forest-light);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      color: var(--ink-primary);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 0.18s ease;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover:not(:disabled) {
      background-color: var(--bg-sub);
    }

    .btn-outline:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    /* 主容器 */
    .container {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 24px 20px 64px;
    }

    /* 首頁公文表頭區 */
    .hero-sheet {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--forest-green);
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-meta-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-line);
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-secondary);
    }

    .hero-tag {
      color: var(--stamp-red);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .hero-sheet h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink-primary);
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .hero-sheet p {
      color: var(--ink-secondary);
      max-width: 820px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .legend-inline {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--bg-sub);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 6px 12px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .swatch-green {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      background-color: #00FF00;
      border: 1px solid #1B241E;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    /* 分頁籤（Tabs）索引卡結構 */
    .tabs-wrapper {
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .tab-nav {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 4px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding-left: 4px;
    }

    .tab-btn {
      background-color: var(--bg-sub);
      color: var(--ink-secondary);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      border-bottom: none;
      padding: 10px 16px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 4px 4px 0 0;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
      position: relative;
      top: 1px;
    }

    .tab-btn:hover {
      background-color: var(--forest-tint);
      color: var(--forest-green);
    }

    .tab-btn.active {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      color: var(--forest-green);
      border: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--bg-card);
      top: 2px;
    }

    .tab-panel {
      display: none;
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      border-top: none;
      padding: 24px;
      animation: fadeIn 0.22s ease;
    }

    .tab-panel.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(3px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* 內容區塊排版 */
    .section-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--forest-green);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .section-badge {
      font-size: 11px;
      background: var(--forest-tint);
      color: var(--forest-green);
      border: 1px solid var(--forest-green);
      padding: 2px 8px;
    }

    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .note-card {
      background-color: var(--bg-paper);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--forest-green);
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }

    .note-card.warn {
      border-left-color: var(--stamp-red);
    }

    .note-card h3 {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: var(--ink-primary);
    }

    .note-card p, .note-card li {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--ink-secondary);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    .note-card ul {
      padding-left: 18px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* 表格樣式 */
    .table-wrap {
      overflow-x: auto;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    table.spec-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13px;
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
    }

    table.spec-table th,
    table.spec-table td {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    table.spec-table th {
      background-color: var(--bg-sub);
      color: var(--ink-primary);
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    table.spec-table tr:nth-child(even) td {
      background-color: rgba(239, 236, 226, 0.35);
    }

    .mono-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--forest-green);
    }

    /* 流程步驟條 */
    .pipeline-steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .step-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      background: var(--bg-paper);
      padding: 12px;
    }

    .step-num {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--stamp-red);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .step-title {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .step-desc {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-secondary);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    /* 實作測試區 */
    .inspection-desk {
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      border: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px var(--border-strong);
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .desk-header {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .desk-header h2 {
      font-size: 19px;
      color: var(--forest-green);
    }

    .shoot-tip {
      background-color: var(--forest-tint);
      border: 1px solid var(--forest-green);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .control-bar {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      background-color: var(--bg-sub);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .file-label {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    input[type="file"] {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      max-width: 100%;
    }

    input[type="file"]:disabled {
      opacity: 0.5;
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }

    .status-strip {
      background-color: var(--bg-paper);
      border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);
      padding: 10px 14px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      font-size: 13px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .status-prefix {
      color: var(--stamp-red);
      font-weight: 700;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    #status {
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--ink-primary);
    }

    .workspace-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .workspace-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    .canvas-frame {
      background-color: #181C19;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .canvas-caption {
      color: #D6DDD8;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-align: left;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    #outputCanvas {
      max-width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #242926;
    }

    /* 評估報告面板 */
    #report {
      display: none;
      background-color: var(--bg-paper);
      border: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding: 18px;
      animation: fadeIn 0.25s ease;
    }

    .report-top {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .report-top h3 {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink-primary);
    }

    .report-stamp {
      border: 1.5px solid var(--stamp-red);
      color: var(--stamp-red);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 1px 6px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .report-field {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .field-label {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    #reportTargets {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 8px 10px;
    }

    #reportLevel {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 8px 10px;
    }

    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    table.detail {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 12px;
      background: var(--bg-card);
    }

    table.detail th,
    table.detail td {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 7px 8px;
      text-align: left;
    }

    table.detail th {
      background: var(--bg-sub);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    #reportAdvice {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-line);
      padding: 10px 12px 10px 26px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    #reportAdvice li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    #reportAdvice li:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .report-footnote {
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-line);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      color: var(--ink-muted);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    /* 頁尾 */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
      background-color: var(--bg-card);
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--ink-secondary);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="brand-stamp">巡檢核章</span>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-title">市政府道路巡檢系統｜斑馬線硬體危險度評估</div>
          <div class="brand-code">DOC-ID: ROAD-CW-2026 // EDGE-ONNX-RUNTIME</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="#inspection-zone" class="btn-primary">前往巡檢測試區 ↓</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <!-- 1. 首頁大標與系統概要 -->
    <section class="hero-sheet">
      <div class="hero-meta-bar">
        <span>執行單位：工務局道路養護工程巡檢科</span>
        <span class="hero-tag">[ 機密等級：公開教學示範版 // 純前端地端運算 ]</span>
      </div>
      <h1>靜態道路硬體危險度評估作業平台</h1>
      <p>
        本系統專為第一線道路巡檢人員設計，於瀏覽器本機端載入輕量化 YOLO 視覺模型（<code>./best.onnx</code>），針對行車記錄器或巡檢車前向街景影像進行行人穿越道（斑馬線）定位與標線物理品質量化分析，自動產出標準化硬體危險度評估報告。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#inspection-zone" class="btn-primary">開始影像巡檢作業</a>
        <div class="legend-inline">
          <span class="swatch-green"></span>
          <span><strong>偵測圖例：</strong>綠色外框（<code>#00FF00</code>）標示 <code>crosswalk</code> 斑馬線，標籤百分比代表模型預測信心程度。</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 分頁籤（Tabs）：收納技術規格與巡檢規範 -->
    <section class="tabs-wrapper" aria-label="巡檢系統技術規範分頁">
      <div class="tab-nav" role="tablist">
        <button class="tab-btn active" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-tab="tab-capabilities">01. 核心辨識與特色</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="tab-criteria">02. 五項評估標準</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="tab-scenarios">03. 交通風險與限制</button>
        <button class="tab-btn" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-tab="tab-architecture">04. 訓練與系統架構</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Tab 1: 核心 AI 辨識能力 + 技術特色 -->
      <div id="tab-capabilities" class="tab-panel active" role="tabpanel">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>核心 AI 辨識能力與地端技術特色</h2>
          <span class="section-badge">SPEC-01 // CAPABILITIES</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-2">
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>1. 斑馬線空間偵測（YOLO26n）</h3>
            <p>透過 ONNX Runtime Web 執行單類別物件偵測，精準定位街景影像中的行人穿越道（<code>class 0: crosswalk</code>），並以非極大值抑制（NMS）過濾重疊框。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>2. 標線物理狀態像素分析</h3>
            <p>直接從原始未壓印框線的高解析度影像裁切目標區域，透過灰階直方圖百分位差與平均亮度，客觀量化標線褪色、磨損及現場能見度。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>3. 駕駛視角空間幾何評估</h3>
            <p>針對前向行車視角計算斑馬線在畫面中的高度佔比與底邊距，判斷是否存在車頭視線盲區或路口停止線過近造成的空間壓迫。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>4. 風險分級報告自動彙整</h3>
            <p>依據五項量化指標加總 0 至 7 分，自動判定低、中、高風險等級，並針對異常扣分項目產生對應的養護與駕駛提醒建議。</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section-header" style="margin-top: 22px;">
          <h2>系統三大技術架構特色</h2>
          <span class="section-badge">EDGE-COMPUTING</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>純地端推論（影像不上傳）</h3>
            <p>所有張量前處理、模型推論與像素運算皆在用戶瀏覽器記憶體完成，巡檢照片完全不經外部伺服器傳輸，確保影像隱私與資安合規。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>Letterbox 等比例空間標定</h3>
            <p>採用等比例縮放並補灰邊（<code>rgb(114,114,114)</code>）輸入 640×640 張量，避免畫面拉伸變形，確保還原至原圖座標後的幾何比例精確無誤。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="note-card">
            <h3>可調式規則決策引擎</h3>
